                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I just played this game. It lasts for about 1 hour. Don't judge it by its price. The game consists on several stories about different people and walks us through their lives and minds. \n\nThe stories are interesting, deep and easy to follow, the narrative is pretty good as well, the soundtrack is beautiful and fits quite well, the gameplay is simple except for some interesting minigames it has and you can tell that the developers have put big thought and effort on making this game.\n\nI won't give it a score because I feel that number would depend a lot on who is playing it but personally I have really liked it and I hope it gets popular; I'd love to see more games from this studio in the future.",
